          "description": "A havocfang, when it makes a charge attack, he also deals double damage with his gore attack and gains a free action to do a trip combat maneuver. On a failed combat maneuver check, the havocfang is not tripped in return. This ability works only on creatures of a size equal to or smaller than the havocfang.",
