          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Long-whiskered relative of the sabertusk indigenous to Cleigne. The havocfang is easily the most intimidating member of the sabertusk family by nature of its eerie appearance, hostile demeanor, and brute strength, it is said that the sound of its howl can drive a man to madness."
